Package: apt.cydiakk.qqhelper
Name: QQ Helper
Version: 1.2.7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: QQ Helper rebuilt for QQ 6.2. Keeps the original settings panel, so its switches control this implementation. Adds a working Recall entry on long-press (including bypassing the local two-minute check), keeps message anti-revoke, and adds Qzone ad removal. The QQ8-only cleanup features are intentionally omitted because QQ 6.2 does not have those elements.
Maintainer: Netskao
Author: Netskao
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 7.0), preferenceloader
Replaces: apt.cydiakk.qqhelper (<< 1.2.7)
Provides: apt.cydiakk.qqhelper (= 1.2.7)
